### 1. Dynamic Workspace Re-Binding (`ADR-005` / `FR-021`)
* When a customer corrects an intent attribute (e.g. changing budget from $75 to $150 or recipient from "Mom" to "Mum"), the system must **rebind downstream workspace tiles dynamically** without crashing, dropping cart items, or forcing a page reload.

### 2. Fail-Closed AI Boundaries & Degraded Fallbacks (`ADR-016` / `quality.py`)
* If an LLM provider fails, times out, or produces unapproved facets, `QualityMonitor` catches the error fail-closed.
* The system gracefully degrades to reference intent interpreters (`ReferenceIntentInterpreter`) or approved policy text—**zero unapproved fabrications ever escape to the customer**.

### 3. Autonomous Webhook Self-Healing Engine (`agent_gateway.py` / #252)
* Pipeline or process failures trigger automated webhook POSTs (`/webhooks/gitlab`).
* The system acknowledges the event, analyzes root cause, and drafts an auto-remediation MR—converting operational failure into automated self-healing.

### 4. Non-Degrading Pre-Flight Guard Network (`scripts/run_all_guards.py`)
* Every bug fix or architecture change must add or strengthen an automated guard (now 14/14 guards).
* Guard standards can only ratchet tighter over time; no guard may ever be bypassed, commented out, or weakened.

### 5. Second Brain Continuous Learning Loop (`research/random-thoughts/`)
* Every incident, bug, or post-mortem is extracted into a git-versioned memory node under `research/random-thoughts/`.
* `@aea-knowledge-guardian` links memory nodes to canonical ADRs via `[[wikilinks]]` so the system never repeats a past failure.

---

## Operating Rule for All Stakeholders & Agents

Before submitting code, opening MRs, or modifying architecture:
1. **Stress-Test Failure Modes**: Ensure new code handles missing fields, database disconnects, or LLM timeouts cleanly.
2. **Never Swallow Errors**: Record error telemetry to `orchestration.ai_quality_event` or outbox logs.
3. **Ratchet Guards**: Run `python scripts/run_all_guards.py` to verify all 14 guards pass cleanly.
